    "created_at": "2022-05-17T07:52:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-05-17T07:52:15Z",
    "body": "It got stricter about images. So we either have to make the images available to the build environment or we add `width`/`height` attributes to all of them. The latter is how we fixed a similar issue elsewhere and how I suggest we proceed here.\r\n\r\ncc @domenic as fyi",
