    "created_at": "2022-05-17T17:56:30Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-05-17T17:56:30Z",
    "body": "Yes, it's a Good Thing to provide image dimensions in the source (prevents layout shift as the images load), and Bikeshed will automatically compute and insert those *if* it can find the image locally; if it can't, it'll complain at you to insert them yourself. This was added last year, I believe, so specs which haven't been touched in a while might not be clean in this regard.",
